            <description><![CDATA[<h2>ScreenTake 0.1.18</h2><ul><li>Finish trimmed-recording audio processing without encoding the video again when audio levels are unchanged, avoiding the stalled processing path and preserving rendered video quality.</li><li>Show the processing stage after audio merging completes.</li><li>Improve selected-strip deletion and timeline drag previews, and retain zoom transition motion in saved projects.</li></ul><p>Includes in-app updates and the long-export improvements from earlier versions. Save your editable project before updating. Versions through 0.1.15 require a manual installation.</p>]]></description>
