            <description><![CDATA[<h2>ScreenTake 0.1.17</h2><ul><li>Reduce temporary disk use during imported-video exports while preserving original media, current results, Undo references, and saved projects.</li><li>Keep generated frames evenly spaced in long imported-video exports with many zooms.</li><li>Validated a 15-minute imported video with 300 zooms and audio at 1080p. The exact reported failure remains unconfirmed without the original clip or error message.</li></ul><p>Includes in-app updates, editing shortcuts, and Mirror Camera. Versions through 0.1.15 need a manual installation.</p>]]></description>
